sequenceDiagram
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant Inv as Invalidator
    participant Cache as Cache layers (Ch 12)

    VM->>Repo: updateProduct(p1, price)
    Repo->>Cache: upsert product p1 (Room SSOT)
    Repo->>Inv: onWrite(p1, "product")
    Inv->>Cache: evict memory[p1]
    Inv->>Cache: evict dependents - listings, search, category of p1
    Note over Cache: next read of those views refetches or recomputes
    Cache-->>VM: Flow re-emits fresh
